      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norfolk%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Norfolk Academy, founded in 1728, is the city’s oldest private school and one of Virginia’s oldest schools overall.",
